    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d358-a1">

                <pb facs="0693" n="633" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg633"/>

                <head>[Telegram.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">New Orleans</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-06-15"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 15, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>To <hi rendition="#small-caps">T. N. Navarro</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Mexican Consul</hi>:</p>
                <p>An expedition against Mexico is fitted out here. Ship Island is the place of
                    reunion. Matamoras the place to land at. I have informed General Buchanan.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>RAMON S. DIAZ, <hi rendition="#italic">Mexican
                    Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
